                        "review": "[h1]Great game design, bad character design[/h1]\n\nI feel like this game would've taken off in a major way if the character designs were better.\n\nThe gameplay is nearly flawless - the ammo count, jump height and dash length all feel precisely tuned for frantic, frenetic PvP, and there's plenty of modifiers. The slide is admittedly a bit fiddly.\n\nIn our game, we also had the issue of not being able to remap gamepad controls (the in-game menu only does keyboard keys) which is unfortunate.\n\nBut there's still plenty to recommend here! Just, don't expect your friends or family to be wild about the selection screen.",
